Third-party content notice

The pattern catalog in references/ai-tells.md derives from "Wikipedia: Signs of
AI writing", maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup, available under CC BY-SA 4.0:
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing

references/clarity-rules.md paraphrases the rule categories of ASD-STE100
Issue 9 (January 2025). It does not reproduce the standard's text or its
approved-word dictionary. ASD-STE100 is free to obtain but not free to
redistribute; Issue 9 page 2 restricts reproduction to eight listed categories
of organization. Request the standard from https://www.asd-ste100.org/
